Restore signed WORD reads in the multiplayer league background descriptor.

View_MultiLeague @0x454b80 loads DWORD [0x46b618] at 0x454bfa
then SAR 16 at 0x454bff for Y, and DWORD [0x46b61a] at 0x454bf1
then SAR 16 at 0x454bf6 for width before Draw_Semi_Trans_Poly @0x451ab8.
Both values are signed WORDs, at 0x46b61a and 0x46b61c respectively.
The original rectangle is (-142,-42,282,120). BYTE aliases yielded Y=214
and width=26, placing the steady table background outside its intended area.

--- a/dd2_symbols.h
+++ b/dd2_symbols.h
@@ -2926,1 +2926,1 @@
-#define _DAT_0046b61a (*(undefined1*)GIMG(0x0046b61a))
+#define _DAT_0046b61a (*(short*)GIMG(0x0046b61a))
@@ -3095,1 +3095,1 @@
-#define _DAT_0046b61c (*(undefined1*)GIMG(0x0046b61c))
+#define _DAT_0046b61c (*(short*)GIMG(0x0046b61c))
